  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Vacant and ready for you to move in, this welcoming two-bedroom home is a lovely place to begin your next chapter. Whether you’re buying your first home or looking to downsize, settle into your own space with the Eastern Bays close by.\r\n\r\nIt features two bedrooms, one bathroom, a dedicated carport and a private lawn and sunny deck — a lovely spot for your morning coffee, a little gardening or simply relaxing at home.\r\n\r\nSt Heliers Beach and Village are about three minutes away by car, making it easy to pop out for a coffee, browse the local shops, or enjoy a seaside stroll. Nearby Mission Bay offers waterfront dining and relaxed beach days, while convenient access to Auckland’s CBD keeps work and city outings within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWith immediate possession available, you can move in, unpack and start making this home your own.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendors are committed to selling. Join us at this weekend’s open home — we look forward to welcoming you.",
